WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Your work. Remembered.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Preferences you ask to remember, ready next time.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Remembers how you work and what to keep an eye on.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.500
Delegate a real task directly from the assistant chat.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.000
From one document to a decision you can act on.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
iDou reads a real Feishu document and creates HTML and Markdown briefs.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Sourced insights become a two-week action plan.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Local work tasks deliver results and document open questions.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
One environment per person, reused across chats. Multi-user architecture illustration.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Open a browser on your dedicated cloud computer, through chat.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Read the real remote page and bring back its view and results.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Switch to the desktop view on the same cloud computer.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Close the session window. Keep your environment.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Post-reboot acceptance capture: the noncredential website test marker is still readable.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Save common task instructions. Edit before reusing.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.000
Authorize ongoing, read-only checks of selected sources.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.000
Shown: an existing responsibility checking document changes hourly.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:43.000
Delegate to this account's cloud computer with standard access.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:49.000
The same cloud task kept running after iDou quit and finished 159 seconds later.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Reopen the original chat to preview and save the same result.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:01.000
iDou assistant preview. The core project is open source.
